{"3894110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zargog", "steam_appid": 3894110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIASMIC GENESIS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is lost. The miasma has covered all. A creation of evil was wrought with the newly found intelligence of ancient alien-visitors who instructed a guild of sorcerers on how to manifest perfect Utopia. Abusing this new knowledge, corruption has taken over, and the power was used to create Utopia for only one, while all the world must pay the price. Zargogs power eventually consumed him after many ages. His body now trapped in a dark tower, forever spewing forth the miasma, Life on Uhnin has mutated into monstrous nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE MAGICIAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the sky a comet falls, the martyred king holding the artifact made from the communion with galaxies far away,  the order of priests of A'tria. Strange creatures, who imbued the artifact with a soul who can enter the miasma and destroy Zargog. Born in a desecrated tomb, a prison-world, the hero seeks the favor of various entities to discover power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIASMIC GENESIS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is lost. The miasma has covered all. A creation of evil was wrought with the newly found intelligence of ancient alien-visitors who instructed a guild of sorcerers on how to manifest perfect Utopia. Abusing this new knowledge, corruption has taken over, and the power was used to create Utopia for only one, while all the world must pay the price. Zargogs power eventually consumed him after many ages. His body now trapped in a dark tower, forever spewing forth the miasma, Life on Uhnin has mutated into monstrous nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE MAGICIAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the sky a comet falls, the martyred king holding the artifact made from the communion with galaxies far away,  the order of priests of A'tria. Strange creatures, who imbued the artifact with a soul who can enter the miasma and destroy Zargog. Born in a desecrated tomb, a prison-world, the hero seeks the favor of various entities to discover power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dark-fantasy horror and RPG meet in space. Escape the Tomb and somehow travel to the post-apocalyptic world drowned in miasma to discover the purpose of your powers. Fight the demons all the way, inside and out. Discover entities to power-up, and be weary of dark agents hunting you.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894110/3b7df0728379c344b4648387d68a55d4b34ef112/header.jpg?t=1768259703", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894110/d39d4eb463297713e96b35fd42c1d7f70b9c1f06/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768259703", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3894110/d39d4eb463297713e96b35fd42c1d7f70b9c1f06/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768259703", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 SP1+, Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 660 / AMD Radeon HD 7870 (DirectX 11 support)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX-compatible sound card</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas